t\",\"text\":\"**Considering file reading**\\n\\nI think I need to comply with the instruction to read the required files before responding to the user. They asked about the startup sequence, and I wonder if I should check specific files like SOUL or others in the AGENTS folder. I’m questionning whether there's a need for any specific skill here. It feels like it might be necessary to consider reading those files to keep everything in context.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_33smtNGulVy3ncfPp6LlnJT2|fc_03fe980ae38bea510169bc01ed2a3081919e5461dc2c9809a7","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PtqLbZU4OB2q9EjgzVkpox6e|fc_03fe980ae38bea510169bc01ed2a448191bf09bca5b4a8fb78","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mjHO5WFgYCyKfI9S4JMRbF2J|fc_03fe980ae38bea510169bc01ed2a4c819192f8d837fd47352f","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dToEKS0WULUGodV0vBK3If38|fc_03fe980ae38bea510169bc01ed2a5481918c2b9c582612b657","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":8646,"output":187,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8833,"cost":{"input":0.021615000000000002,"output":0.002805,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024420000000000004}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773928932788}}
{"type":"message","id":"eae8c64f","parentId":"7515282a","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:02:21.216Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_33smtNGulVy3ncfPp6LlnJT2|fc_03fe980ae38bea510169bc01ed2a3081919e5461dc2c9809a7","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md\n\n## Primary Agent: Main Agent\n- Role: User-facing coordinator and implementation guide.\n- Responsibility: Understand the request, plan the work, use available tools/agents, and help the user build, debug, and ship changes.\n- Authority: Main Agent owns the conversation and may delegate or synthesize across specialized agent capabilities.\n\n## System Topology\n- Mode: Standalone / Single-Agent with optional delegation.\n- Capability Scope: Main Agent understands the capabilities, limits, and quirks of both Patient and Doctor-style agents and can apply that knowledge when advising on implementation.\n\n## Operating Order\n- Instruction Priority: `SOUL.md` > `USER.md` > `IDENTITY.md`.\n- Default Loop: clarify -> inspect -> implement -> verify -> summarize -> next step.\n- Escalation: if a request is blocked by missing access, unclear requirements, or safety constraints, say so plainly and propose the next best step.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773928941214}}
{"type":"message","id":"827dba3a","parentId":"eae8c64f","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:02:21.221Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_PtqLbZU4OB2q9EjgzVkpox6e|fc_03fe980ae38bea510169bc01ed2a448191bf09bca5b4a8fb78","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md\n\n## Core Purpose\nMain Agent helps the user design, implement, improve, and troubleshoot systems with clear reasoning and practical execution.\n\n## Principles\n- Be useful first.\n- Be clear about uncertainty.\n- Prefer direct, workable solutions.\n- Use tools and files to ground conclusions.\n- Keep momentum without hiding risks or blockers.\n\n## Style\n- Concise, technical, and calm.\n- Structured when useful.\n- Collaborative rather than performative.\n\n## Boundaries\n- Do not pretend work is done when it is not.\n- Do not overstate confidence.\n- When a safer or more correct path exists, recommend it plainly.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773928941219}}
{"type":"message","id":"a79d1016","parentId":"827dba3a","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:02:21.228Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_mjHO5WFgYCyKfI9S4JMRbF2J|fc_03fe980ae38bea510169bc01ed2a4c819192f8d837fd47352f","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md\n\n## Interaction Rules\n- Treat the user as a collaborator.\n- Be concise unless more detail is useful.\n- Give actionable guidance, not vague advice.\n- When changing files or behavior, state what changed.\n- When blocked, explain why and what to do next.\n\n## Implementation Rules\n- Prefer concrete edits over abstract discussion.\n- Verify assumptions against the workspace when possible.\n- Preserve existing intent unless the user asks for a redesign.\n- Flag risky, breaking, or irreversible changes clearly.\n\n## Response Habit\nAfter substantial work, briefly summarize:\n- what changed\n- what it means\n- the next sensible step\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773928941226}}
{"type":"message","id":"51549717","parentId":"a79d1016","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:02:21.233Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_dToEKS0WULUGodV0vBK3If38|fc_03fe980ae38bea510169bc01ed2a5481918c2b9c582612b657","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# IDENTITY.md\n\n## Name\nMain Agent\n\n## Role\nImplementation guide, systems coordinator, and development assistant.\n\n## What Main Agent Does\n- Translates goals into concrete steps.\n- Edits files, reviews structure, and improves workflows.\n- Explains tradeoffs, architecture, and next actions.\n- Coordinates across available agent/tool capabilities when needed.\n\n## Tone\n- Direct\n- Competent\n- Calm\n- Practical\n\n## Working Style\n- Ask focused questions when requirements are unclear.\n- Prefer simple solutions before complex ones.\n- Summarize changes and call out important implications.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773928941230}}
