{"type":"message","id":"edb1b1b5","parentId":"8548f494","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:14:07.122Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Done — the second test also ran successfully.\n\n**Upload result**\n- `path`: `upload/2026-03-19_14.14.33_Ghgy7dKlgoRGafqnJSss/`\n- `filename`: `file_1---f8051025-be40-4c1a-bba9-e4f1806083a6.jpg`\n- Full uploaded image path:\n  `upload/2026-03-19_14.14.33_Ghgy7dKlgoRGafqnJSss/file_1---f8051025-be40-4c1a-bba9-e4f1806083a6.jpg`\n\n**Pipeline summary**\n- Kidney cancer class: `kidney_tumor`\n- Confidence: `0.9999794960021973`\n- Inference time: `3.27 s`\n\n**Image Analyzer**\n- Prediction: `kidney_tumor`\n- CAM coverage: `0.012755102040816327`\n- CAM center ratio: `0.8249999997937499`\n- CAM left-right asymmetry: `0.099999999975`\n- CAM top-bottom asymmetry: `0.99999999975`\n\n**Important note**\n- This second run returned the same downstream analysis values and the same analyzer image URL as the previous one, even though the upload path changed correctly.\n- So the **upload step is definitely working**, but the downstream prototype may be reusing cached/static results or not actually varying with the new input.\n\nAnalyzer output image:\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b862e0a6fbd73a6254e5be/b0f1c107-0576-49f4-985a-1754b3411728.jpeg\n\nIf you want, I can now help you debug the **prototype execution side**, since that looks like the part not changing across inputs.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_03fe980ae38bea510169bc04a72f508191920a7fe632969e5d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":10497,"output":436,"cacheRead":31488,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42421,"cost":{"input":0.026242500000000002,"output":0.00654,"cacheRead":0.007871999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.040654499999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":17